docs
# ...except the one docs file the RENDERER genuinely bundles. StatusSurface.tsx does a Vite
# `?raw` import of it, reached from Canvas.tsx, so without this exception `electron-vite build`
# fails to resolve the import inside the container. This break was invisible for as long as it
# existed because `npm run build` died earlier still, on a missing scripts/ gate.
!docs/assets/shots/capture-manifest.json
